The '''Anaxes Separatist Security Outpost''' was located<ref name="The Bad Batch" /> on the [[planet]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|fort-anaxes|Fort Anaxes}}</ref> [[Anaxes]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] and was utilized as a security outpost for the [[Confederacy military|military forces]] of the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] during the [[Battle of Anaxes]] of the [[Clone Wars]]<ref name="The Bad Batch" /> in [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TCWcanondates|701}}</ref> the war's final [[Standard year|year]].<ref name="SWGA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> During the battle, the outpost, maintained by several [[B1-series battle droid]]s, was infiltrated by the [[clone commando]] [[squad]], [[Clone Force 99]], led by [[Clone Sergeant]] [[Hunter]] and the [[501st Legion]], under orders from [[Clone Captain]] [[Rex|CT-7567]]. After the Republic vacated the outpost in order to infiltrate the Confederacy's [[Cyber Center]], a [[Unidentified Separatist platoon|platoon]] of [[battle droid]]s arrived at the outpost as a [[T-series military strategic analysis and tactics droid|T-series tactical droid]] reported his investigations to [[Harch]] Separatist [[Admiral]] [[Trench]].<ref name="The Bad Batch" />

